spans.s:
व्युत्थित a. gone asunder, split;
 diverging, differing;
roused, excited;
 (±धर्मात्) forgetful of one's duty, disloyal.

व्युत्पन्न a. developed, derived (g.);
 taught, educated,
versed in (instr.).

व्युषित a. shone up, grown bright;
 loc. व्युषिते at
daybreak.

व्युष्ट a. shone up, grown bright;
 loc. व्युषिते at
daybreak.

व्यु॑ष्टि f. shining up, growing bright, dawning;
 reward for
(gen., loc., or —˚), requital, retaliation;
 grace, beauty.

व्यूह॑ m. shifting, dislocation, distribution, disposition,
arrangement, military array;
 totality, a whole or complex;
 host, troop,
multitude;
 detailed explanation or description.

व्यूहन a. & n. placing apart, separating;
 n. also
shifting, change, development.
